      "title_hi": "अभ्यास Q2",
      "title_gu": "વ્યાયામ Q2",
      "question": "What is the central theme of the sonnet?",
      "question_hi": "सॉनेट का केंद्रीय विषय (central theme) क्या है?",
      "question_gu": "સોનેટની કેન્દ્રીય થીમ (central theme) શું છે?",
      "options": [
        "The glory of ancient kings and their architectural skills.",
